 MACRO&lab pop &C1&lab pla sta &C1 pla sta &C1+2 mend MACRO&lab moveA &C1,&C2&lab lda &C1 sta &C2 lda &C1+2 sta &C2+2 mend MACRO RtoR &C1,&C2 ENTRY &C1.to&C2&C1.to&C2 lda &C1.tag sta &C2.tag lda sign&C1 sta sign&C2 lda expn&C1 sta expn&C2 lda expn&C1+2 sta expn&C2+2 ldx lgth&C1 stx lgth&C2 bmi z2&C1&C2z1&C1&C2 lda Frct&C1,x sta Frct&C2,x dex dex bpl z1&C1&C2z2&C1&C2 rts MEND MACRO RtoRXpn &C1,&C2,&C3 lda &C1.tag sta &C2.tag lda sign&C3 sta sign&C2 lda expn&C3 sta expn&C2 lda expn&C3+2 sta expn&C2+2 ldx lgth&C1 stx lgth&C2z&C1&C2&C3 lda Frct&C1,x sta Frct&C2,x dex dex bpl z&C1&C2&C3 MEND